            "bodyHtml": "<p>Complete the notes below. Write <strong>ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER</strong> for each answer.</p><div><div class=\"notes-title\"><strong>Beach Heads Travel — Customer Request Sheet</strong></div><ul><li>Name: Duncan White</li><li>Group details: three adults and two children</li><li>Date of arrival: {{1}} <em>(staying for 2 weeks)</em></li></ul><p class=\"sub-head\">Week One</p><p class=\"sub-head\"><strong>Accommodation:</strong></p><ul><li>book a {{2}} on the beach</li><li>budget is around ${{3}} a night</li></ul><p class=\"sub-head\"><strong>Activities:</strong></p><ul><li>the children want to go {{4}}</li><li>arrange for them to have a {{5}}</li><li>book a time for Susan and Jenny to play {{6}}</li><li>Duncan wants to go {{7}}</li></ul><p class=\"sub-head\">Week Two</p><p class=\"sub-head\"><strong>Accommodation:</strong></p><ul><li>National Park — book a {{8}} ($100 per night)</li></ul><p class=\"sub-head\"><strong>Activities:</strong></p><ul><li>arrange a {{9}} for Jenny</li><li>send Duncan a {{10}} for Marco's</li></ul></div>",
