            "rubricHtml": "<p>Questions 21–23</p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "bodyHtml": "<p>Complete the notes below. Write <strong>ONE WORD ONLY</strong> for each answer.</p><div><div class=\"notes-title\"><strong>Products using renewable energy sources</strong></div><p class=\"sub-head\"><strong>a) Kites produced by German company</strong></p><ul><li>are attached to ships by long cables</li><li>can use wind power in any {{21}}</li><li>could reduce toxic emissions by 50%</li></ul><p class=\"sub-head\"><strong>b) Sports car produced by US company</strong></p><ul><li>uses {{22}} as a power source</li><li>will have zero emissions</li></ul><p><strong>c) Ethanol stoves produced in South Africa</strong></p><ul><li>are safer than paraffin stoves</li><li>less likely to {{23}}</li></ul></div>",
            "maxWords": 1
          },
